\b SEL LIVE Windows Agent\b0\par
\par
Internal software of Shyama Electrical Ltd. Installation and use are subject to company IT and monitoring policy.\par
\par
\b What this software records\b0\par
While you are signed in on a company computer, it records which application is in the foreground and for how long, whether the keyboard and mouse are in use, lock and unlock times, and your sign-in and sign-out times.\par
\par
\b What it never records\b0\par
It contains no keyboard hook and captures no keystrokes. It does not capture passwords, clipboard contents, the text of emails, chats or documents, screenshots, screen recordings, webcam or microphone. It does not read browsing history.\par
\par
Window titles and website domains are optional, are switched off by default, and are enforced on the server rather than trusted to this software.\par
\par
\b Seeing your own record\b0\par
Open the SEL LIVE icon in the system tray and choose Agent status to see exactly what is switched on for this computer, or visit the Windows Agent section of SEL LIVE to see what has been recorded about you.\par
\par
Questions about this software should go to your IT administrator.\par
